@host = http://localhost:5238
@adminToken = cole-aqui-o-token-do-admin
@customerToken = cole-aqui-o-token-do-cliente

### Login do admin (criado automaticamente em Development)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@pedeaqui.dev", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Cadastro de cliente
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cliente Teste", "email": "cliente@pedeaqui.dev", "password": "Cliente@123" }

### Cadastrar produto (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Pizza Margherita", "description": "Molho, mussarela e manjericão", "sku": "PIZZA-MARG", "price": 49.90 }

### Catálogo (público)
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Entrada de estoque (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/stock/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 20, "reason": "Compra do fornecedor" }

### Consultar estoque e histórico (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/products/1/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar pedido (cliente)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Alterar itens do pedido (cliente, só pendente)
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 3 } ] }

### Listar meus pedidos
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Cancelar pedido (devolve o estoque)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Confirmar pedido (admin)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
